# Unused brace-import names that predate the unused-import lint
# (AGAST #3458, LARB review/5 harland F4). Checked by
# projects/ritz/tools/test_check_unused_imports.py: a new unused import
# anywhere in kernel/src fails, and so does an entry here once its name is
# used or removed. Delete lines; never add them. The kernel entry module
# (main.ritz) may not appear here.
